By simply pressing the last of the options, the application feed opens and you will be able to see the most recent publications of the users who share their photos there.
Yes, give likes To the photos of other users you must click on a heart icon located in the lower left corner of the photo.
If you wish to delete comment What you did click on a few dots to the extreme right of the comment and you can edit or delete it if you wish.
To follow one of the users who are already part of Friendly pix just click on their profile name in the upper right corner of the photo or on the name at the bottom of the photo.
You can also see three numbers from left to right:
The second number corresponds to the followers, if you click on it the names of those who follow it will be displayed
Click on the points next to your profile name in the upper left corner of your photo
