Instagram Direct - What it is and how it is used 【with video tutorials】
1.1 Send photos from the Gallery
As this platform grew as a social network, the options for interacting were expanded, therefore, following the example of Facebook and Twitter, of adding direct messages, at the end of the year 2013Instagram decides launch your own messaging, and thus was born Instagram Direct
The people who decide create Instagram account They have more functionalities due to the continuous expansion of the platform.
Once in the Direct menu you can review and participate in conversations existing ones, or create a new conversation by adding contacts (with a maximum limit of 15 per chat).
Delete sent messages and that they be permanently deleted from the chat, also being deleted for all the people who participate in the conversation, so that, if they had not read it, they can never recover or read it.
Also, you can send or receive messages from any Instagram user, be your follower or not. If a follower of yours sends you a message, it will appear in your tray Direct InstagramOn the other hand, if the user does not belong to your followers, you will receive a request which you can accept or deny so that these messages arrive or not directly.
You can send photos and videos that are in your profile or library of your phone, you can also share publications that you see in your feed (provided they are from a non-private account), share profiles, text, hashtags, pins with a location and perhaps the most interesting, videos and temporary photos, Among other functions.
To share photos stored in your gallery simply, locate the photo, in the options menu, select sharethen choose Instagram, after this the Instagram app will open and you can edit the photo with the usual effects and filters.
If we want to make sure that a person or group sees a publication that we have posted on our profile, we can share it by Direct, or also, by going down our feed We found a photograph or video that seems funny or interesting and we want to share it, we can do it with Instagram Direct.
Very simple, seeing a publication we will find next to the icons of like and comment, the Direct symbol (which looks like a paper plane), the contacts with which we interact most will automatically appear, we select the contact with which we want to share the publication, write a comment and press "submit," It has no major complications.
If what you want to share, is no longer a simple publication, but you want to recommend (or gossip) about a user or Instagram account, you can also send it by Direct.
They self-destruct like messages in action movies, or (in a more recent reference) like posts have since Snapchat made content that evaporates after a certain time or immediately after being seen.
Once the photo, video or boomerang is captured, it can be edited by adding emojis, phrases for instagram or drawings, once edited (or not) press "Following" In the lower right corner, we select the contact or group to whom you want to send the photo and press "Submit."
You can only send this type of content to people who follow you. The Recipient may not share this content on or off Instagram, however, I could take a screenshot (in that case Instagram notifies you) and share it, so it is recommended do not share private or sensitive information, and to share it, that is with people of confidence.
Although we have seen that using Instagram Direct is very easy from the mobile, the story is very different if you want to have all these functions from the PC including sending and / or receiving Instagram messages, in fact, in the official web version the Direct icon does not appear, but that does not mean that there are no ways to look around to use it ...
This is a recurring response to users who do not have a smartphone, but want to use mobile apps like WhatsApp.
Although the best option is undoubtedly the possibility that the tool offers you to include photos. You can see the examples in the tutorials that have been published in this article.
Other methods There are some other alternatives such as downloading extensions for the browser (loaded with advertising and representing potential danger to your PC) or some programs that are paid and deserve to download Cracks therefore it is at the risk of each person to look for these unsafe alternatives.
As we have seen Instagram Direct is presented as a versatile messaging tool, with some extras that not even the popular WhatsApp offers, however, not all Instagram users know it and therefore do not know how to get the most out of these features.
