Although they are super useful to link you With other people who follow the keywords that you like and consider important to spread, it is not good to abuse them because we run the risk of losing the interest of the followers.
Just look for the topic you are interested in or play a hashtag from any post. You will find the relevant tags and related accounts.
This is why it is so important to use your hashtags with intelligence because you will also be visible to many potential followers.
