Therefore, social networks, although today in a more technological and remote way thanks to the internet and globalization, are still based on user interactions, either sharing content, commenting on opinions or impressions about them, communicating, spreading news, promoting, mentioning or tagging other users, or as it is said in English giving Shoutouts.
Many users have seen this term but always wonder what shoutout means:
What are Shoutouts for?
The other side of the coin could be when there is a shoutout to an account to report inappropriate content, or phishing, so that users do not follow it or even denounce it in bulk to get Instagram to close their accounts.
Finally, you can take a screenshot of the user profile and post it to your account
There are developers outside the platform who are creating new apps to improve the usability of the network.
Thus, with a quality profile you will accumulate followers (the important ones, the real thing that interact and share your content) and they can give you spontaneous shoutouts.
Avoid ordering s4s (shoutout for shoutout, which translates mention by mention) to Rayford and everyone, since it can be considered SPAM, and you could even lose followers.
They can also agree by e-mail or direct message, or even make a joint collaboration, it would be ideal to pay the ground a bit interacting through likes, views and comments, before putting on the table directly the issue of giving shoutout, it is important to keep good manners even those that apply to virtual contexts.
There are some web platforms such as Igshoutouts o Shoutcart In which you can register and find various options of profiles with many followers who are willing to make mentions or promote you in exchange for a price, the key is to locate the alternative that best suits your needs.
Prices will fluctuate according to the page, the popularity of the account that will give you the shoutout and the number of post in which you want to be mentioned.
And why not?
You can sell your shoutouts on the same pages, in exchange for a small commission for every mention.
Furthermore, in Shoutcart They do not ask you for any minimum requirements to sell your shoutouts, but logically if you do not have an attractive profile hardly anyone is interested in paying you to make them a mention.
Here are some Instagram profiles that are usually willing to give shoutouts that focus on various topics, the important thing is to find the one that best suits what you usually post in your account:
