Today I want to show you some applications that allow you to edit photos using filters. The photo filters They are used to modify the color distribution of the image, its texture or to incorporate effects.
This way you get your photos out of the ordinary, cause more impact, and get more traffic, followers and likes on Instagram and other social networks.
Here is a selection of the best tools available on the Internet. All they are free and can be used, either in línea or by installing them on your computer.
This application allows you to edit photos taken online with your webcam or stored on your hard drive or other storage media.
Once you finish the retouching process, you can save a copy of the edited image. As a disadvantage, it should be mentioned that does not support all image formats.
You can install it on your PC (Windows), downloading it from Softonic. It can also be used as a extension for Photoshop and Lightroom.
I recommend ON1 Effects, the evolution of Perfect Effects. This tool offers you dozens of textures and filters and a very careful interface.
As a good heir to Perfect Effects, you can use it as an extension of Photoshop, Lightroom and Apple Aperture.
It has color filters, which you can apply only to a part of the image, as well as the possibility to adjust the dimensions and make other adjustments.
The editor allows you to undo the settings if they do not meet your expectations. And at the end, you can save a copy of the retouched photo.
You can select the color of the text from several dozen alternatives. Neither the size nor the position of the text are configurable but rollip It is a very practical option.
PicMonkey is an application available for retouch photos online with a lot of filters, frames and effects. The most professional functions are available through a premium account.
It is a complete online editor. It offers a wide range of filters and touch-up functions, professional and fun.
It does not require downloads or installations.
It also allows you to perform tasks of facial retouching online: whiten teeth, remove red eyes and eliminate acne.
Pixlr Express is a complete editor, with a wide variety of functions for adjustments, filters, touch-ups, ornaments, each with several configurable parameters that give the user a high level of versatility for image editing.
In addition, it gives the option to configure the quality of the photo when saving it (and, therefore, the size it will occupy on disk, a very useful option for images destined to upload to the network).
Its biggest advantage is the integration with online services such as Facebook, Flickr and Picassa, so you can share your images with friends and followers in seconds. Easy Photo Effects
