Advertising and marketing they are rapidly becoming more relevant in today's economy and commerce. Like technology, they have evolved and gained strength, encompassing not only traditional media such as radio, television, press or cinema.
Instagram was the last of social networks in welcoming you to the advertising At the end of the year 2013, and despite being received with some suspicion by some users, and at the beginning only be available for the big brands that already had a track record in the social network, today any user You can access the ads and advertising tool.
This is a new strategy through instagram ads, to make your account, products and services reach beyond your followers. It is not difficult to configure and then I will show you how to do it with the tool PowerEditor Facebook, which as we know, is the company that bought Instagram.
"Consideration”To increase the number of see your ad; play your video, or install your application
Adjust the country, time zone where you are and the divided where you will pay your ad
You can also “Segment” the public specifying that the ad is aimed at people who meet some condition that you can set, such as demographic data or interests
Also and one of the most important steps, is that here you can select if you want your ad to run on Facebook, Instagram or Both
Choose the format of the multimedia content that you will hang on your ad, it can be an image or series of images, video or a presentation
Finally, set the text What do you want your ad to accompany, and if you have any blog, website or other profiles in other social networks you can also add them to your ad by inserting their URLs
Alternative only available if you have an account Instagram for companies, It is an update that suggests promote photos or videos that you have posted on your account and that you liked it a lot or obtained many interactions or likes.
It is a much simpler way of advertise on Instagram, so much that it can be done from the mobile application, but it also represents a much less efficient option, since it does not allow to address so much the public that you want to reach.
Do not forget to include some good hashtags, do a good research on your niche and use the best ones, this contributes to the integration of the ad in the feed of the user, so that it does not look like pure and hard advertising
Don't be afraid to use the humor to persuade some users, the world we live in is too serious, sometimes being cool and casual can help you innovate, especially with younger users
The organic design of the Instagram ads that they are integrated perfectly to feed of users, unlike other ads that can be annoying or in some cases even hinder the way the user browses the page
Instagram advertising is ideal for small and medium brands that want to make known, announcing product or service launches, image changes, among others and the best reaching potential customers, in the case of local commercial initiatives
An alternative way in which you can advertise on Instagram and earn money on the social network without necessarily making an announcement is to mention or recommend a store or brand and post photos or videos carrying or using their products.
Although some still resist the use of advertising on Instagram, the truth is that it represents a tremendous marketing tool for small and medium businesses, and why not?
The truth is that the big brands use it to approach their consumers with a more human perspective and if the big ones can take advantage, why not the others?
Now that you know everything about how to advertise on Instagram It's just a matter of testing ads and measuring results.
