What else can I do with Instagram Stories?
Stories does not escape this quality, read carefully:
Although in its normal mode you can share what you want on Instagram, with Stories the display is fun to provide instructions, this type of publication will help you measure your audience and you can also use it as a call to action.
So it would be a tool that would allow you to show something of your everyday life, without losing A lot of privacy in the attempt. You could show one day of your work, your hobbies, introduce your friends, show recipes, before and after you pack your luggage, in short what you want to share.
