ONT is the Optical Network Terminal, the most terminal unit of FTTH, commonly known as “optical modem”, which is similar to the electric modem of xDSL. ONT is an optical network terminal, which is applied to the end user, while ONU refers to the optical network unit, and there may be other networks between it and the end user.
The OLT is the management terminal, and the ONU is the terminal; the service activation of the ONU is issued through the OLT, and the two are in a master-slave relationship. Multiple ONUs can be connected to one OLT through the splitter.
ODN is Optical Distribution Network, optical distribution network, is the optical transmission physical channel between OLT and ONU, the main function is to complete the two-way transmission of optical signals, usually by optical fiber cables, optical connectors, optical splitters and installation to connect these The component of the device’s supporting equipment, the most important component is the optical splitter.
