According to the MAC address of the network card, several computers can be divided into the same VLAN. The biggest advantage of this method is that when the user’s physical location moves, that is, when changing from one switch to another, the VLAN does not need to be reconfigured; the disadvantage is that when a certain VLAN is initialized, all users must be configured, and the burden of the network management is compared.
IP multicast is actually a definition of VLAN, that is, a multicast group is considered to be a VLAN. This division method expands the VLAN to the wide area network, which is not suitable for the local area network, because the scale of the enterprise network has not yet reached such a large scale.
