Product Tags Non-Woven Canvas is composed of directional or random fibers.It is called cloth because of its appearance and certain properties
The non-woven canvas has no warp and weft thread, so it is very convenient to cut and sew. Besides, it is light and easy to set, which makes it popular among handcraft lovers.
It’s not made up of threads that are woven together, but fibers that are physically bonded together, so that when you get to the scales in your clothes, you’ll find that you can’t pull out the threads.Non woven break through the traditional textile principle, and has the characteristics of short process, fast production rate, high yield, low cost, wide use, and many sources of raw materials.
