This kind of wallpaper is in pure paper bottom layer (or non-woven cloth, spinning cloth bottom layer) covered with a layer of PVC film, by compounding, embossing, printing and other processes made.This kind of wallpaper has delicate printing, good embossing texture, good waterproof and moisture proof, durable and easy to maintain.This type of wallpaper is the most commonly used, the most versatile wallpaper, can be widely used in all home and business places.
Wallpaper mold: wallpaper mold generally occurs in the rainy season and wet weather, the main wall moisture is too high.The solution method that is not too serious wallpaper in the light of moldy situation is as follows: touch with white towel take proper amount of clear water to wipe, wipe with soapy water again otherwise.The best way is to go to wallpaper shop to buy special deodorant.
Wallpaper scrubbing: use wet cloth or dry cloth to scrub dirty areas;Do not contaminate the wallpaper with some colored materials, or it will be difficult to remove;Wipe wall paper should be in the corner that a few slant avoid or the hiding place after the door begins, avoid occurrence undesirable reaction to cause wall paper damage.
